@claimBaseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@authBaseUrl = http://localhost:8082
@auditBaseUrl = http://localhost:8086

### Scenario 30
### Async claim -> additional info -> tenant response -> penalty applied
### Notes:
### - assessment runs asynchronously in assessment-service
### - poll GET /api/claims/{id} after create and after additional-info

### 30.1 List seeded users
GET {{authBaseUrl}}/api/auth/users

### 30.2 Create claim with amount >= 200 so first async assessment asks for additional info
# @name createClaim
POST {{claimBaseUrl}}/api/claims
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "landlordUserId": 1,
  "tenantUserId": 3,
  "title": "Broken sofa and stained carpet",
  "description": "Tenant left visible damage and the claim requires asynchronous assessment.",
  "claimedAmount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### 30.3 Poll claim until status becomes NEED_ADDITIONAL_INFO
GET {{claimBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}

### 30.4 Send additional info and trigger reassessment
POST {{claimBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}/additional-info
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "landlordUserId": 1,
  "comment": "Uploaded serial number and room overview separately; reassess please."
}

### 30.5 Poll claim until status becomes AWAITING_TENANT_RESPONSE
GET {{claimBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}

### 30.6 Tenant responds
POST {{claimBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}/tenant-response
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantUserId": 3,
  "agree": false,
  "comment": "I disagree with the final amount."
}

### 30.7 Admin requests penalty application
POST {{claimBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}/support-decision
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "adminUserId": 5,
  "applyPenalty": true,
  "penaltyAmount": 175.00,
  "penaltyCurrency": "USD",
  "note": "Proceed with penalty application",
  "simulateFailure": false
}

### 30.8 Poll claim until status becomes PENALTY_APPLIED
GET {{claimBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}

### 30.9 Inspect timeline
GET {{claimBaseUrl}}/api/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}/timeline

### 30.10 Inspect audit trail
GET {{auditBaseUrl}}/api/audit/claims/{{createClaim.response.body.$.id}}/events
